                            <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="9d2e-d14d-dd58-a829">Once per player turn, Elspeth von Draken can re-roll a single dice of her choice concerning her or the Carmine Dragon (this can include attacks, saving throws, magic dice and the Artillery dice used to determine the Carmine Dragon&apos;s Coruscating blast if desired). If this re-roll is not used, at the end of her player&apos;s turn Elspeth von Draken may recover a wound previously lost in the game.</characteristic>
