    <infoGroup name="Storm of Shemtec Chart" id="4462-5ddc-613a-4d00" hidden="false">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="1 Sudden Downpour" id="0d8f-1bda-4010-d188" hidden="false" typeId="d549-1f73-1ba5-861c" typeName="Table / Chart">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Result" typeId="686b-22d8-d67f-02eb">No effect.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="2 Iceshard Tempest" id="7905-9603-5b72-02ce" hidden="false" typeId="d549-1f73-1ba5-861c" typeName="Table / Chart">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Result" typeId="686b-22d8-d67f-02eb">All models hit by the template suffer a Strength 2 hit with Ice Attacks. In addition, they suffer a -1 modifier to all To Hit rolls (both shooting and close combat) until the start of the caster&apos;s next Magic phase. Shooting attacks that do not use BS are unaffected.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="3 Raging Tornado" id="ab4d-1dd8-9720-039e" hidden="false" typeId="d549-1f73-1ba5-861c" typeName="Table / Chart">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Result" typeId="686b-22d8-d67f-02eb">If a target unit lies beneath the template&apos;s central hole and is not engaged in close combat, roll a scatter dice and rotate the unit so that it is facing that direction (if a hit is rolled, the casting player chooses the direction). If, by rotating the unit, it would come within of another unit or impassable terrain, simply stop rotating the unit as soon as it moves to within 1&quot;.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="4-5 Lightning Strike" id="9439-7707-64ba-0aa9" hidden="false" typeId="d549-1f73-1ba5-861c" typeName="Table / Chart">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Result" typeId="686b-22d8-d67f-02eb">The model under the template&apos;s central hole suffers a Strength 6 hit. Other models hit by the template suffer a Strength 3 hit. This is a Lightning Attack.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="6 Meteor Strike" id="6dd1-017e-5e03-ea5e" hidden="false" typeId="d549-1f73-1ba5-861c" typeName="Table / Chart">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Result" typeId="686b-22d8-d67f-02eb">Meteor Strike: The model under the template&apos;s central hole suffers a Strength 6 hit with Multiple Wounds (D6). All other models hit by the template suffer a Strength 4 hit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </infoGroup>
