                <characteristic name="Range" typeId="2954-76ea-decb-30ff">18&quot;</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Details" typeId="f5f2-ac1b-25cd-89c6">This Spell causes D6 Strength 5 Hits. In addition, the target unit suffers -1 To Hit with missile weapons and in close combat as well as its Leadership until the start of the caster&apos;s next Magic phase. Missile weapons that do not use Ballistics Skull must roll a 4+ on a D6 before firing; if failed they may not shoot that phase.</characteristic>
