                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="3df8-4ab0-c4bd-e2ad">One use only. This item can be used at the start of any enemy Magic Phase. Roll a D3, the result is the casting penalty all enemy Wizards suffer for the duration of this Magic Phase.</characteristic>
