                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="3df8-4ab0-c4bd-e2ad">One use only. After the bearer of the Seal of Destruction manages to successfully dispel an enemy spell, they may choose to use the Seal. If they do so, roll a D6. On a 4+, the spell cannot be used by that Wizard for the rest of the game.</characteristic>
