              <profiles>
                <profile name="Eichelbaum&apos;s Scroll" id="d93f-01be-df1d-8ed8" hidden="false" typeId="ff67-d27f-2eef-bb35" typeName="Enchanted Item">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="9d2e-d14d-dd58-a829">Witch Hunter only. Once per turn, when an enemy spell has been cast, the bearer can use this item instead of attempting to dispel the spell by using dispel dice. This gives them 3 free dice to attempt to dispel the spell, which cannot be combined with any other dispel dice. This may also be used to dispel spells that Remains in Play. However, if the dispel attempt fails, the scroll is destroyed and cannot be used for the remainder of the battle.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
