                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="9d2e-d14d-dd58-a829">At the end of any close combat in which a Monstrous Infantry, Monstrous Beast, Monstrous Cavalry, Monstrous Creature or Monster model suffers one or more unsaved Wounds from the bearer&apos;s close combat attacks, it must take a Toughness test for each such Wound inflicted, and loses a Wound (with no saves allowed) for each test failed..</characteristic>
