              <profiles>
                <profile name="Aldred&apos;s Casket of Sorcery" id="6ee7-a410-6dab-cb79" hidden="false" typeId="ff67-d27f-2eef-bb35" typeName="Enchanted Item">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="9d2e-d14d-dd58-a829">Bound Spell. At the start of each of your Magic phases, roll a D6. On the roll of a 4+, the bearer may remove and capture one randomly determined spell up to Level 2 (excluding Signature Spells) from an enemy Wizard within 12&quot;. The bearer can then cast the captured spell in any of your Magic phases by releasing it from the casket just like from a Bound Spell. Any number of spells may be captured by the casket, and the bearer can successfully cast each one once, either over several magic phases or all at the same time if they prefer.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
