                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="9d2e-d14d-dd58-a829">When the wearer fights in a challenge, he must &apos;swap&apos; the WS, S, T, I and A characteristics on his profile with his enemy (but not the enemy&apos;s mount, if he has one). So, the wearer fights with his enemy&apos;s S, T, I and A whilst his enemy fights with the wearer&apos;s S, T, I and A. Note that you cannot choose not to use Van Horstmann&apos;s Speculum and you must swap all of the listed characteristics for the duration of the challenge, not just some of them.</characteristic>
