                    <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="3df8-4ab0-c4bd-e2ad">The bearer of this item gains a +1 casting bonus when using the Lore of Shadow or Death. In addition, they know one more spell than normal. However, they also have the Independant special rule. .</characteristic>
